msgstr "Inserisci la chiave MDBList dal telefono (QR)"

msgctxt "#30541"
msgid "Get a free OMDb key: https://www.omdbapi.com/apikey.aspx"
msgstr "Ottieni una chiave OMDb gratuita: https://www.omdbapi.com/apikey.aspx"

msgctxt "#30542"
msgid "Get a free MDBList key (sign in, then API key): https://mdblist.com/preferences/"
msgstr "Ottieni una chiave MDBList gratuita (accedi, poi chiave API): https://mdblist.com/preferences/"

msgctxt "#30543"
msgid "OMDb API key, get one at https://www.omdbapi.com/apikey.aspx"
msgstr "Chiave API OMDb, disponibile su https://www.omdbapi.com/apikey.aspx"

msgctxt "#30544"
msgid "MDBList API key, get one at https://mdblist.com/preferences/"
msgstr "Chiave API MDBList, disponibile su https://mdblist.com/preferences/"

msgctxt "#30546"
msgid "Shows a QR code. Scan it with your phone, paste the key there and it's saved here."
msgstr "Mostra un codice QR. Scansionalo con il telefono e incolla lì la chiave per salvarla qui."

msgctxt "#30547"
msgid "Want MDBList scores? Get a free key at https://mdblist.com/preferences/ (sign in, then generate an API key) and enter it here. MDBList also adds the Rotten Tomatoes audience score."
msgstr "Vuoi i voti di MDBList? Ottieni una chiave gratuita su https://mdblist.com/preferences/ (accedi, poi genera una chiave API) e inseriscila qui. MDBList aggiunge anche il voto del pubblico di Rotten Tomatoes."

